WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
One idea. Your entire studio.
Anharmonic Studios.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Find the moment.
Select it. Slice it. Make it yours.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Give it a pulse.
Play the pads. Build your rhythm.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Turn sound into melody.
Play samples chromatically. Draw the notes.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Shape your signature.
Oscillators. Filters. Envelopes. Arpeggios.

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Build the big picture.
Layer patterns. Move clips. Find the flow.

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Make every layer count.
Balance. EQ. Saturation. Space.

8
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Make room for your voice.
Record takes. Shape your vocal sound.

9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
From idea to WAV.
Export your arrangement in 24-bit stereo.

10
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Anharmonic Studios.
Make something only you can.
